  "title": "ntfy Notifications",
  "body": "I just got Rayhunter installed and am wanting to setup the ntfy notifications so that if it detects something it can just alert me without me having to monitor the device. I made my ntfy server and put the URL into the webportal and it accepted it and tried the \"test heuristic\" which did spit out warnings on the web portal but nothing got pushed over to my phone. Is there something else I'm missing or need to do?",
