      "body": "What ntfy client are you using? I had the same problem with the ntfy iOS client but when I switched to Android I got the alerts right away.\r\n\r\nThis is not a rayhunter bug. It is a bug in the poorly written iOS ntfy client.\r\n\r\nHope this helps",
